#: ../gwexpy-ja-v0111-v0114-release-notes/CHANGELOG.md:1290 65766dda1a394b1baab8476b89442126
msgid ""
"**Migration Note**: Using deprecated `nperseg` or `noverlap` parameters will raise `TypeError` "
