#: ../gwexpy-ja-v0111-v0114-release-notes/CHANGELOG.md:1321 7ab8b070a14242e49e140498f34f7a33
msgid ""
"**Exception Handling**: Eliminated broad `except Exception` patterns in NDS, GUI, and IO modules."
" Replaced with specific exception types (`OSError`, `ValueError`, `KeyError`, etc.) for more "
"predictable error handling and better debugging."
msgstr ""
"**例外処理**: NDS、GUI、IO モジュールにおける広範な `except Exception` "
"パターンを排除しました。より予測しやすいエラー処理とデバッグ性の向上のため、特定の例外型（`OSError`、`ValueError`、`KeyError` など）に置き換えました。"

#: ../gwexpy-ja-v0111-v0114-release-notes/CHANGELOG.md:1322 5a373a86ec164694a7f5a80865de1e78
msgid ""
"**GUI Architecture**: Improved separation of concerns between UI and core logic layers in GUI "
